### Testar registro de nó com dados do sistema
POST http://localhost:8000/api/Sync/register-node
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nodeId": "test-node-123",
  "name": "Test Node",
  "machineName": "DESKTOP-TEST",
  "machineId": "test-machine-456",
  "ipAddress": "127.0.0.1",
  "port": 8000,
  "version": "2.1.3",
  "operatingSystem": "Windows 11 Pro"
}

### Verificar nós registrados no servidor cloud
GET https://localhost:7001/api/DesktopNode/nodes
